Survivors, it's great to see so many of you diving into [b]Metro Awakening[/b] on Steam.

If you’re experiencing any crashes or performance issues, below are a few tips to improve stability and ensure you get the most out of your time in the Metro:

[olist]
[*] First, make sure SteamVR is set as your default OpenXR runtime rather than Windows Mixed Reality (WMR), Oculus, or Viveport. This can boost performance and prevent crashes;
[*] Some programs, like VR Toolkit, OpenXR Toolkit, or ReShade, can interfere with the game, Try disabling them to improve stability;
[*] Turning off overlays and certain OpenXR API layers may also help with performance;
[*] Additionally, setting your Spectator Screen to 'Off' can also help maintain smooth gameplay.
[/olist]

For more troubleshooting guidance, please visit the full support article here: https://to.plaion.com/MetroVRSteamcrash

Or get in touch with our player support: https://to.plaion.com/MetroAwakeningSupport
